{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":14,"ref":"2-chronicles 35:14","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"pcm","chapter":35,"translation":"And after dat, dem bin prepare for dem-self and for di priest-dem; because di priest-dem, pikin-dem of Aharon, bin dey busy dey offer up ⟨את⟩ di burnt offering and ⟨את⟩ di fat-dem until night; so di Leviyim bin prepare for dem-self and for di priest-dem, pikin-dem of Aharon.","tokens":[{"surface":"ואחר","gloss":"and after dat"},{"surface":"הכינו","gloss":"dem bin prepare"},{"surface":"להם","gloss":"for dem-self"},{"surface":"ולכהנים","gloss":"and for di priest-dem"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"because"},{"surface":"הכהנים","gloss":"di priest-dem"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"pikin-dem of"},{"surface":"אהרן","gloss":"Aharon"},{"surface":"בהעלות","gloss":"dey offer up"},{"surface":"העולה","gloss":"di burnt offering"},{"surface":"והחלבים","gloss":"and di fat-dem"},{"surface":"עד","gloss":"until"},{"surface":"לילה","gloss":"night"},{"surface":"והלוים","gloss":"so di Leviyim"},{"surface":"הכינו","gloss":"bin prepare"},{"surface":"להם","gloss":"for dem-self"},{"surface":"ולכהנים","gloss":"and for di priest-dem"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"pikin-dem of"},{"surface":"אהרן","gloss":"Aharon"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-11T14:17:03.226609791Z","model":"glm-5.2"}